ounts, and leaves future authorization gates explicitly open.\n\n## Counts And Gates Captured\n\n- 3530 governed 9709 rows covered with 3530 MS reveal payload rows and 0 missing payload rows.\n- Pre-attempt reveal exposure, public static URL allowance, pre-attempt direct fetch, frontend preload exposure, document-only student reveal, teacher/admin student bypass, raw MS text storage, OCR/VLM/model execution, scoring release, and Smart Mark release are all reported as 0.\n- Page exposure, warning, locator, page asset, crop, fallback, display posture, self-assessment, Copilot boundary, visual QA, dedupe, and PDF locator counts are included.\n- Final future gates remain future-only: full frontend UI integration, production Supabase import, remote disposable rehearsal, production RAG/vector mutation, external model/VLM QA, production scoring/Smart Mark, and policy/legal approval beyond current artifact posture.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-final-closeout.mjs`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-final-closeout.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-read-model-rehearsal.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-handoff.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-review-payload-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `npm run lint:changed`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-final-closeout.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nPreflight remains warning-mode only for the existing branch naming/worktree dirty checks; report/artifact guard and A+ ratchet are healthy.\n","created_at":"2026-07-08T15:56:29Z","updated_at":"2026-